{"seq":3,"slug":"tree-of-thought-search","title":"思维树与搜索","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-llm/llm-agent-planning/paradigms/tree-of-thought-search","wordCount":1364,"readingTime":6,"html":"<h1 id=\"思维树与搜索\">思维树与搜索</h1><p>ReAct 和任务分解都只沿一条路径前进——选定一步就走下去，错了再说。但有些问题里，&quot;哪一步对&quot;本身就需要试探：填字游戏、24 点、需要回溯的多步推理，往往得同时押注几条候选路、走不通就退回换一条。把规划显式地当成在&quot;思路空间&quot;里的搜索，正是思维树（Tree of Thoughts, ToT）这一族方法的出发点。它在<a href=\"../foundations/planning-taxonomy\">范式谱系</a>的&quot;是否搜索&quot;轴上站到了多轨搜索这一极，代价是算力陡增。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>思维树把规划建模成一棵搜索树：节点是一个&quot;思路状态&quot;（已走过的部分推理/计划），边是&quot;再走一步思路&quot;。在每个节点，LLM 既当<strong>生成器</strong>（提出若干候选下一步），又当<strong>评估器</strong>（给每个候选打分，判断它有多可能通向解）。然后用经典搜索策略决定扩展哪些节点、剪掉哪些。</p>\n<p>它与单轨范式的根本区别在于<strong>回溯（backtracking）</strong>：走进死胡同时，ToT 能退回上层换一条分支，而 ReAct/分解只能硬着头皮往下或整体重来。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;    Root[初始问题] --&gt; N1[思路A]&#10;    Root --&gt; N2[思路B]&#10;    Root --&gt; N3[思路C]&#10;    N1 --&gt; N1a[A1 评分0.8]&#10;    N1 --&gt; N1b[A2 评分0.3 剪枝]&#10;    N2 --&gt; N2a[B1 评分0.2 剪枝]&#10;    N3 --&gt; N3a[C1 评分0.7]&#10;    N1a --&gt; Goal[到达解]&#10;    N3a -.回溯.-&gt; N3\">flowchart TD\n    Root[初始问题] --&gt; N1[思路A]\n    Root --&gt; N2[思路B]\n    Root --&gt; N3[思路C]\n    N1 --&gt; N1a[A1 评分0.8]\n    N1 --&gt; N1b[A2 评分0.3 剪枝]\n    N2 --&gt; N2a[B1 评分0.2 剪枝]\n    N3 --&gt; N3a[C1 评分0.7]\n    N1a --&gt; Goal[到达解]\n    N3a -.回溯.-&gt; N3</pre><p>下表把单轨范式与多轨搜索的取舍摆清楚：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>维度</th>\n<th>单轨（ReAct/分解）</th>\n<th>多轨搜索（ToT/MCTS）</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>同时维护路径数</td>\n<td>1</td>\n<td>多（束宽/采样数）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>回溯能力</td>\n<td>无（只能整体重来）</td>\n<td>有</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>解难题能力</td>\n<td>弱</td>\n<td>强</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>LLM 调用量</td>\n<td>线性</td>\n<td>接近指数</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>适用任务</td>\n<td>一般任务</td>\n<td>高价值、可付算力的难题</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"从-tot-到搜索算法谱系\">从 ToT 到搜索算法谱系</h2><p>ToT 是一个框架，具体&quot;怎么搜&quot;可套不同经典搜索算法，构成一个谱系。下表按&quot;探索充分性 vs 算力&quot;排列：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>搜索策略</th>\n<th>在 ToT 中如何用</th>\n<th>特点</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>广度优先（BFS）</td>\n<td>每层保留全部/前 k 个节点逐层扩展</td>\n<td>不漏解，算力高</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>束搜索（Beam）</td>\n<td>每层只留评分最高的 b 个</td>\n<td>算力可控，可能漏最优</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>深度优先（DFS）</td>\n<td>沿一条分支走到底，失败再回溯</td>\n<td>省内存，可能久陷死胡同</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>蒙特卡洛树搜索（MCTS）</td>\n<td>选择—扩展—模拟—回传四步循环</td>\n<td>用采样平衡探索与利用</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p><strong>束搜索</strong>是工程上最常见的折中：维护固定束宽 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>b</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">b</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">b</span></span></span></span></span>，每层只保留评分最高的 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>b</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">b</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">b</span></span></span></span></span> 个节点，把指数爆炸压成 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>O</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>b</mi><mo>⋅</mo><mi>d</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">O(b \\cdot d)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">O</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">b</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">d</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span>（<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>d</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">d</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">d</span></span></span></span></span> 为深度）。</p>\n<p><strong>蒙特卡洛树搜索（MCTS）</strong> 更精巧，它用上置信界（UCB）公式在&quot;利用已知好节点&quot;与&quot;探索未知节点&quot;间权衡：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>UCB</mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>n</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><munder><munder><mfrac><mrow><mi>Q</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>n</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><mrow><mi>N</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>n</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow></mfrac><mo stretchy=\"true\">⏟</mo></munder><mtext>利用</mtext></munder><mo>+</mo><munder><munder><mrow><mi>c</mi><msqrt><mfrac><mrow><mi>ln</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mi>N</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mtext>parent</mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><mrow><mi>N</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>n</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow></mfrac></msqrt></mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\">⏟</mo></munder><mtext>探索</mtext></munder></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{UCB}(n) = \\underbrace{\\frac{Q(n)}{N(n)}}_{\\text{利用}} + \\underbrace{c\\sqrt{\\frac{\\ln N(\\text{parent})}{N(n)}}}_{\\text{探索}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">UCB</span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:3.6893em;vertical-align:-2.2623em;\"></span><span class=\"minner munder\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.427em;\"><span style=\"top:-1.1647em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.427em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback mtight\">利用</span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.427em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.427em;\"></span><span class=\"minner munder\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.427em;\"><span class=\"svg-align\" style=\"top:-1.843em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.427em;\"></span><span class=\"stretchy\" style=\"height:0.548em;min-width:1.6em;\"><span class=\"brace-left\" style=\"height:0.548em;\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"400em\" height=\"0.548em\" viewBox=\"0 0 400000 548\" preserveAspectRatio=\"xMinYMin slice\"><path d=\"M0 6l6-6h17c12.688 0 19.313.3 20 1 4 4 7.313 8.3 10 13\n 35.313 51.3 80.813 93.8 136.5 127.5 55.688 33.7 117.188 55.8 184.5 66.5.688\n 0 2 .3 4 1 18.688 2.7 76 4.3 172 5h399450v120H429l-6-1c-124.688-8-235-61.7\n-331-161C60.687 138.7 32.312 99.3 7 54L0 41V6z\"/></svg></span><span class=\"brace-center\" style=\"height:0.548em;\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"400em\" height=\"0.548em\" viewBox=\"0 0 400000 548\" preserveAspectRatio=\"xMidYMin slice\"><path d=\"M199572 214\nc100.7 8.3 195.3 44 280 108 55.3 42 101.7 93 139 153l9 14c2.7-4 5.7-8.7 9-14\n 53.3-86.7 123.7-153 211-199 66.7-36 137.3-56.3 212-62h199568v120H200432c-178.3\n 11.7-311.7 78.3-403 201-6 8-9.7 12-11 12-.7.7-6.7 1-18 1s-17.3-.3-18-1c-1.3 0\n-5-4-11-12-44.7-59.3-101.3-106.3-170-141s-145.3-54.3-229-60H0V214z\"/></svg></span><span class=\"brace-right\" style=\"height:0.548em;\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"400em\" height=\"0.548em\" viewBox=\"0 0 400000 548\" preserveAspectRatio=\"xMaxYMin slice\"><path d=\"M399994 0l6 6v35l-6 11c-56 104-135.3 181.3-238 232-57.3\n 28.7-117 45-179 50H-300V214h399897c43.3-7 81-15 113-26 100.7-33 179.7-91 237\n-174 2.7-5 6-9 10-13 .7-1 7.3-1 20-1h17z\"/></svg></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.427em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.427em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.427em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">Q</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.936em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.584em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:2.2623em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:4.3663em;vertical-align:-2.487em;\"></span><span class=\"minner munder\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.8794em;\"><span style=\"top:-1.3924em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.8794em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback mtight\">探索</span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.8794em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.8794em;\"></span><span class=\"minner munder\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.8794em;\"><span class=\"svg-align\" style=\"top:-2.0707em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.8794em;\"></span><span class=\"stretchy\" style=\"height:0.548em;min-width:1.6em;\"><span class=\"brace-left\" style=\"height:0.548em;\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"400em\" height=\"0.548em\" viewBox=\"0 0 400000 548\" preserveAspectRatio=\"xMinYMin slice\"><path d=\"M0 6l6-6h17c12.688 0 19.313.3 20 1 4 4 7.313 8.3 10 13\n 35.313 51.3 80.813 93.8 136.5 127.5 55.688 33.7 117.188 55.8 184.5 66.5.688\n 0 2 .3 4 1 18.688 2.7 76 4.3 172 5h399450v120H429l-6-1c-124.688-8-235-61.7\n-331-161C60.687 138.7 32.312 99.3 7 54L0 41V6z\"/></svg></span><span class=\"brace-center\" style=\"height:0.548em;\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"400em\" height=\"0.548em\" viewBox=\"0 0 400000 548\" preserveAspectRatio=\"xMidYMin slice\"><path d=\"M199572 214\nc100.7 8.3 195.3 44 280 108 55.3 42 101.7 93 139 153l9 14c2.7-4 5.7-8.7 9-14\n 53.3-86.7 123.7-153 211-199 66.7-36 137.3-56.3 212-62h199568v120H200432c-178.3\n 11.7-311.7 78.3-403 201-6 8-9.7 12-11 12-.7.7-6.7 1-18 1s-17.3-.3-18-1c-1.3 0\n-5-4-11-12-44.7-59.3-101.3-106.3-170-141s-145.3-54.3-229-60H0V214z\"/></svg></span><span class=\"brace-right\" style=\"height:0.548em;\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"400em\" height=\"0.548em\" viewBox=\"0 0 400000 548\" preserveAspectRatio=\"xMaxYMin slice\"><path d=\"M399994 0l6 6v35l-6 11c-56 104-135.3 181.3-238 232-57.3\n 28.7-117 45-179 50H-300V214h399897c43.3-7 81-15 113-26 100.7-33 179.7-91 237\n-174 2.7-5 6-9 10-13 .7-1 7.3-1 20-1h17z\"/></svg></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.8794em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.8794em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">c</span><span class=\"mord sqrt\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.8794em;\"><span class=\"svg-align\" style=\"top:-5em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:5em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\" style=\"padding-left:1em;\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.427em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mop\">ln</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">parent</span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.936em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.8394em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:5em;\"></span><span class=\"hide-tail\" style=\"min-width:1.02em;height:3.08em;\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"400em\" height=\"3.08em\" viewBox=\"0 0 400000 3240\" preserveAspectRatio=\"xMinYMin slice\"><path d=\"M473,2793\nc339.3,-1799.3,509.3,-2700,510,-2702 l0 -0\nc3.3,-7.3,9.3,-11,18,-11 H400000v40H1017.7\ns-90.5,478,-276.2,1466c-185.7,988,-279.5,1483,-281.5,1485c-2,6,-10,9,-24,9\nc-8,0,-12,-0.7,-12,-2c0,-1.3,-5.3,-32,-16,-92c-50.7,-293.3,-119.7,-693.3,-207,-1200\nc0,-1.3,-5.3,8.7,-16,30c-10.7,21.3,-21.3,42.7,-32,64s-16,33,-16,33s-26,-26,-26,-26\ns76,-153,76,-153s77,-151,77,-151c0.7,0.7,35.7,202,105,604c67.3,400.7,102,602.7,104,\n606zM1001 80h400000v40H1017.7z\"/></svg></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.1606em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.8086em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:2.487em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>Q</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>n</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">Q(n)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">Q</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span> 是节点累积价值，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>N</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>n</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">N(n)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span> 是访问次数，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>c</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">c</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">c</span></span></span></span></span> 调节探索强度。把 MCTS 与 LLM 反思结合的代表是 LATS（Language Agent Tree Search），它在树搜索的每个节点引入<a href=\"../adaptation/reflection-self-critique\">反思</a>信号来评估与改进——这是搜索与自适应的交汇点。</p>\n<h2 id=\"评估函数-搜索的灵魂\">评估函数：搜索的灵魂</h2><p>搜索的成败，七成在评估函数——它决定扩展谁、剪掉谁。ToT 里 LLM 自评有三种常见形式：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"python\" data-code=\"# 形式1：数值打分——让模型给每个候选思路打 0-1 的&quot;通向解&quot;概率&#10;score = llm(f&quot;这条思路解决问题的可能性(0-1)：{thought}&quot;)&#10;&#10;# 形式2：投票——多个候选两两比较，胜出者晋级&#10;winner = llm(f&quot;以下哪条思路更可能正确？{candidates}&quot;)&#10;&#10;# 形式3：可行性分类——sure / maybe / impossible 三档，直接剪掉 impossible&#10;verdict = llm(f&quot;这条思路可行吗(sure/maybe/impossible)：{thought}&quot;)\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># 形式1：数值打分——让模型给每个候选思路打 0-1 的\"通向解\"概率</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">score </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> llm(</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">f</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"这条思路解决问题的可能性(0-1)：</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">{</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">thought</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">}</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># 形式2：投票——多个候选两两比较，胜出者晋级</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">winner </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> llm(</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">f</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"以下哪条思路更可能正确？</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">{</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">candidates</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">}</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># 形式3：可行性分类——sure / maybe / impossible 三档，直接剪掉 impossible</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">verdict </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> llm(</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">f</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"这条思路可行吗(sure/maybe/impossible)：</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">{</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">thought</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">}</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span></code></pre></div><p>评估函数的可靠性是 ToT 的阿喀琉斯之踵：如果 LLM 自评不准，搜索就在错误的引导下浪费算力，甚至剪掉正确分支。这与<a href=\"../practice/planning-evaluation\">规划评测</a>里&quot;过程评估难于结果评估&quot;是同一个困难的两面——一个不可靠的验证器既毁搜索也毁纠错。</p>\n<h2 id=\"算力账-什么时候值得上搜索\">算力账：什么时候值得上搜索</h2><p>多轨搜索本质是用测试时计算换正确率。问题是：值不值？</p>\n<p>设束宽 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>b</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">b</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">b</span></span></span></span></span>、深度 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>d</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">d</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">d</span></span></span></span></span>、每节点评估调用 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>e</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">e</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">e</span></span></span></span></span> 次，则总 LLM 调用约 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>b</mi><mo>⋅</mo><mi>d</mi><mo>⋅</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><mi>e</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">b \\cdot d \\cdot (1+e)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">b</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">d</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">e</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span> ——相比 ReAct 的 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>d</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">d</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">d</span></span></span></span></span> 次，开销放大 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>b</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><mi>e</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">b(1+e)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">b</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">e</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span> 倍。一个 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>b</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>5</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">b=5</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">b</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">5</span></span></span></span></span>、<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>e</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">e=1</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">e</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span></span></span></span></span> 的中等配置就是十倍调用量。因此搜索只在三个条件同时满足时划算：</p>\n<ol>\n<li><strong>任务确实难到单轨解不了</strong>（存在大量看似可行的死胡同）；</li>\n<li><strong>正确性价值高</strong>（一次错误的代价远超额外算力成本）；</li>\n<li><strong>有可靠的评估信号</strong>（自评或外部校验器靠谱，否则搜索是盲搜）。</li>\n</ol>\n<p>反过来，对简单任务或评估信号不可靠的开放任务，搜索往往是负收益——多花十倍算力却被坏评估带偏。这条判据把思维树牢牢钉在<a href=\"../foundations/planning-taxonomy\">范式谱系</a>的&quot;高价值难题&quot;角落，而非通用默认。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>思维树把规划显式建模为搜索树：LLM 兼任生成器与评估器，配合经典搜索策略扩展/剪枝，核心能力是单轨范式没有的回溯。</li>\n<li>搜索策略构成谱系：BFS 不漏解但贵、束搜索压成 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>O</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>b</mi><mo>⋅</mo><mi>d</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">O(b\\cdot d)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">O</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">b</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">d</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span>、DFS 省内存、MCTS 用 UCB 平衡探索与利用；LATS 把 MCTS 与反思结合。</li>\n<li>评估函数是搜索的灵魂，其可靠性是阿喀琉斯之踵——坏评估会剪掉正解、浪费算力。</li>\n<li>搜索是&quot;用测试时计算换正确率&quot;，开销约放大 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>b</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><mi>e</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">b(1+e)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">b</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">e</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span> 倍，仅在任务难、价值高、评估可靠三条件同时满足时划算。</li>\n<li>它在范式谱系里属&quot;高价值难题&quot;专用，而非通用默认。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"延伸阅读\">延伸阅读</h2><ul>\n<li>同章前两篇（单轨范式，搜索是其超集）：<a href=\"react-interleaved\">ReAct 交错推理</a>、<a href=\"task-decomposition\">任务分解</a>。</li>\n<li>评估器与反思的交汇：<a href=\"../adaptation/reflection-self-critique\">反思与自我批评</a>。</li>\n<li>评估信号可靠性的展开：<a href=\"../practice/planning-evaluation\">规划评测</a>。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"思维树与搜索","id":"思维树与搜索"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"从 ToT 到搜索算法谱系","id":"从-tot-到搜索算法谱系"},{"level":2,"text":"评估函数：搜索的灵魂","id":"评估函数-搜索的灵魂"},{"level":2,"text":"算力账：什么时候值得上搜索","id":"算力账-什么时候值得上搜索"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"},{"level":2,"text":"延伸阅读","id":"延伸阅读"}],"prev":{"title":"任务分解","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-llm/llm-agent-planning/paradigms/task-decomposition"},"next":{"title":"反思与自我批评","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-llm/llm-agent-planning/adaptation/reflection-self-critique"}}